Chris, alpha if what you need to change the transparency:

final_plot <- plot_sim_and_real + stat_summary(geom="ribbon",

fun.ymin="min", fun.ymax="max", alpha = 0.7)

Next time maybe you could save the data to a file, post it online and then use read.table("url") to make the code shorter.

HTH
Luciano

