Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hello --

I need to plot x=weekday, y=count from a data frame called 'result':

weekdays     med
MON 56260.0
TUE 56814.0
WED 63163.0
THU 52629.0
FRI 48006.0
SAT 32809.5
SUN 39459.5

I try a bar chart:
p <- ggplot(result,aes(weekdays,med))
p + layer(geom="bar")

But the x-axis plots the weekdays as follows: F, M, Sa, Su, Th, Tu, W

Can anyone shed any light on why this happens and how to override it?

thank you in advance, Andrew
ggplot2 rules btw!

