but for more conveninece I also uploaded the csv file in here:
http://www.4shared.com/dir/zKX992vV/sharing.html

the code I worked out so far:

diox<-read.csv("scatter.csv",sep=",", dec=".")

basic<-qplot(x_avg, y_avg, data=diox, colour=labels, shape=cut,
xlab="x", ylab="y", main="the main title")
basic + scale_x_log10(xlim=c(0, max(c(diox$x_avg,diox$y_avg)))) +
scale_y_log10(ylim=c(0, max(c(diox$x_avg,diox$y_avg))))

thanks

max

