Another suggestion (with the same result) would be to order the levels of the factor with factor()

result$day <- factor(result$day, levels = c("Mon", "Tue", "Wed", "Thu", "Fri", "Sat", "Sun"))

ggplot(result, aes(day, count)) +

geom_bar()

I haven't tried it, but perhaps you could use as.date() and a scale_date(). If your data is coming in as a date this should be easy. Quick-R has a nice guide for converting the different formats you get from excel (and others).

B

